      },
      "jp": "てか、リーダーなんだし<CR>私が企画すべきだったよね",
      "en_original": "But I feel like I should've arranged this whole thing... I'm supposedly the leader after all.",
      "en_auxiliary": null,
      "en": "But I feel like I should've arranged this whole thing... I'm supposedly the leader after all.",
