      "jp": "逆だよ。これまでたくさん頑張ってくれたんだから、<CR>愛央ちゃんはどっしり構えてればいいの",
      "en_original": "Don't be silly. You've already done so much for us. We just want to help you get through all of this.",
      "en_auxiliary": null,
      "en": "It's the opposite. You've already worked so hard, Ao-chan, that you should sit back and let everyone else handle things.",
      "alignment": {
        "status": "exact_index_msg_id",
        "initial_en_source": "official_en",
        "official_en_index": 4,
        "official_en_mapping": "exact_index_msg_id",
