        ]
      },
      "jp": "……今だって、すごい大変な状況でさ。<CR>神とかオリジンとか言われて、もう頭パンク状態なわけ",
      "en_original": "We're in a pretty bad spot, y'know? God, Origin, whatever you wanna call it, I feel like my brain's gonna explode just thinking about it.",
      "en_auxiliary": null,
      "en": "We're in a pretty bad spot, y'know? God, Origin, whatever you wanna call it, I feel like my brain's gonna explode just thinking about it.",
